      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGEND\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2500\u2500 \u25c6 Composition (owns)\n\u2500\u2500 \u25b6 Association (uses)\n- - \u25b7 Extends / Implements\n\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 \u25b6 Creates\n\nColors:\n  Yellow  = Enum\n  Blue    = Interface\n  Purple  = Abstract Class\n  Green   = Singleton\n  Orange  = Decorator\n  Pink    = Factory\n  White   = Concrete Class",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "legend",
      "originalText": "LEGEND\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2500\u2500 \u25c6 Composition (owns)\n\u2500\u2500 \u25b6 Association (uses)\n- - \u25b7 Extends / Implements\n\u00b7\u00b7\u00b7 \u25b6 Creates\n\nColors:\n  Yellow  = Enum\n  Blue    = Interface\n  Purple  = Abstract Class\n  Green   = Singleton\n  Orange  = Decorator\n  Pink    = Factory\n  White   = Concrete Class",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
